# Journey Abroad in Metalworks, a level 30 Warrior of San d'Oria with the mission current and the Letter to the
# Consuls held. Chantain, Lutia, Riault and Savae E Paleade are triggered at status 0, 1, 3, 6, 7, 8, 10 and 11.
# Status 7: Chantain 216, Lutia 213 and Riault 210 (Savae is not triggered: its finish would end the mission); status
# 11: Chantain 218, Lutia 215, Riault 212 and Savae 209; the other statuses the zone's own events: Chantain 203, Lutia
# 202, Riault 201 and Savae 208. Status 2: Chantain 203, Lutia 202 and Riault 201; Savae plays 204, whose finish ends
# this mission, begins Journey to Bastok, moves to status 3 and takes the letter.
